WEBVTT

00:08:29.826 --> 00:08:32.496
I think that can make a big difference.

00:08:32.496 --> 00:08:34.006
SRK: Yes, really.

00:08:34.006 --> 00:08:36.086
(Applause)

00:08:36.086 --> 00:08:40.036
Sundar, it's called 'Internet Saathi' 
you said.

00:08:40.036 --> 00:08:41.416
SP: 'Internet Saathi'

00:08:41.416 --> 00:08:45.276
SRK: As per Sundar, in the country

00:08:45.276 --> 00:08:48.196
they are working with 100 thousand women,

00:08:48.196 --> 00:08:51.896
in the villages,
that each have a smartphone.

00:08:51.896 --> 00:08:55.896
With the use of this app 'Internet Saathi'

00:08:55.896 --> 00:08:58.526
they are able to solve their problems

00:08:58.526 --> 00:09:02.484
and in the coming years, they want 
one billion people to have smartphones